title: "Controlling Coding Agent Sessions From Your Phone"
description: "How I use OpenCode Web, Tailscale, and ntfy to monitor and steer local coding agent sessions from my phone."
publishedAt: "2026-08-09"
tags:
  - AI
  - workflow
